1000 GOSUB 9000:GOSUB 6000:BM$="`Urgh...!`\That wasn't the hotel. Though it was a solid stone building, it was crumbling\apart, as if it had been bombed.":GOSUB 5100
1010 BM$="For reasons unknown even to himself, David began to walk.":GOSUB 5100
2010 GOSUB 6100:BM$="As he reached what appeared to be the entrance, he realized that it was\some kind of ancient building, made of stone and bricks.":GOSUB 5100
2015 BM$="`...Where am I? There's nothing else I can do but go inside...`":GOSUB 5100
2020 COMMON FO:GOSUB 6110:BM$="Inside, there were stone pillars, lined up like in a temple; however, the\ceiling and many of the pillars had been destroyed. The night sky was\visible.":GOSUB 5100
2025 BM$="`...How did I get here? This was supposed to be the hotel!`":GOSUB 5100
2026 BM$="`There seems to be a way further in. I guess I'll have to follow it...`":GOSUB 5100
2030 GOSUB 6120:BM$="There was a room in the back of the temple, but it was in ruins. Nobody was\inside.":GOSUB 5100
2035 BM$="`This place is ancient. Maybe I'm so tired that instead of the hotel I went\inside some historical ruins or something.`":GOSUB 5100
2036 BM$="`I can see the sky ahead. A little further and I should be out.`":GOSUB 5100
2040 GOSUB 6130:BM$="The building was in shambles, as if it had been hit by an earthquake. With\many paths blocked by rubble, he was unable to simply walk forward.":GOSUB 5100
2045 BM$="`I see a clear path ahead. Just a little further. I'm almost there...`":GOSUB 5100
2050 GOSUB 6140:BM$="He could see what appeared to be a courtyard, or maybe the entrance of\the building.":GOSUB 5100
2056 BM$="`...I thought I was finally out, but looks like I'm still inside the building. What\ruins are these anyway? I have no idea what I'm doing...`":GOSUB 5100
2060 GOSUB 6100:BM$="As he stepped through the entrance, he found himself in an ancient\building, made of stone and bricks.":GOSUB 5100
2065 BM$="`What the - I've been here already! But there's no way I've been going in\circles!`":GOSUB 5100
2066 BM$="`...I'll just go inside and remove all doubts.`":GOSUB 5100
2070 GOSUB 6110:BM$="He entered a temple with ruined stone pillars.":GOSUB 5100
2075 BM$="`See, it's the temple from earlier. I must be in one of my nightmares... I can\see outside the building from there. I'll just climb over the wall, that'll do\the trick.`":GOSUB 5100
2080 GOSUB 6120:BM$="The night sky was visible beyond the destroyed room.":GOSUB 5100
2085 BM$="`Yeah, just like I thought. Forget the path, I'm climbing over the wall this\time.`":GOSUB 5100
2086 GOSUB 9515:BM$="Just as he was about to climb over, David heard a human voice from the\path he ignored.":GOSUB 5100
2087 BM$="David stopped climbing the wall, and ran through the path, trying to reach\the source of the voice.":GOSUB 5100
2090 GOSUB 6130:BM$="The path was full of stones and bricks from nearby fallen buildings. He\could hear a man groaning from the building in front of him.":GOSUB 5100
2230 GOSUB 9515:BM$="`Whoever he is, he's hurt. I need to help him.`":GOSUB 5100
2240 COMMON FO:BM$="By reflex, David ran towards the source of the voice.":GOSUB 5100
